Abstract: This paper summarizes the Invoking Annotations proposal: an annotation is invoked at compile time for each declaration or base-specifier it applies to whenever the type of its value declares a callee with a `std::meta::annotation_context` parameter. The invocation is a mandatory constant evaluation that can reject the construct but changes neither it nor the annotation.
